# "Search your library for an Island or Swamp card" is a search by land type (CR 205.3i): Volcanic Island is an Island and Mountain, so
# it is found (the Island branch the existing scenario does not take) while a plain Mountain and a Forest are not (refusals). The
# second Delta in hand on turn 3 is then activated and the search is answered with nothing (a quality search may find nothing, CR
# 701.23b): the land is still sacrificed and the life still paid.

[Bot1 Deck]
Polluted Delta
Polluted Delta
Mountain x5
Volcanic Island
Mountain
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Polluted Delta.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Polluted Delta.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Mountain)
! Bot1.Search(Forest)
Bot1.Search(Volcanic Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Polluted Delta.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Polluted Delta.Activate
Bot1.Search()

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Polluted Delta; Polluted Delta
Bot1.Battlefield = Volcanic Island
